# Adapted from EYE reasoning examples (MIT, Jos De Roo).
# Source: https://eyereasoner.github.io/eye/reasoning/issue141/
# Standalone program; EYE answer directives use log:query.

# Source file: issue141/test3.n3
@base <https://eyereasoner.github.io/eye/reasoning/issue141/test3.n3>.
@prefix : <http://www.example.com/ns/ex#> .

{?p a :Reflexive} => {
    {?x ?p ?x} <= {?x ?p ?y}.
}.

{?p a :Reflexive} => {
    {?y ?p ?y} <= {?x ?p ?y}.
}.

:p a :Reflexive.

